%T A062747 2876525797465,67710590623655,1612262780199001,38764533106581415,
%U A062747 939825790848884825,22950405085586497447
%N A062747 Row sums of (unsigned) staircase array A062746.
%F A062747 a(n)=N(3; k, x=-1), with the polynomials N(3; k, x) from the staircase array A062746.
%F A062747 a(n) = 2*( Sum_{j = 0..n} (-1)^j*C(3; n-j)*4^(n-j) ) - (-1)^n with C(3; n) := A001764(n) = A062993(n+1, 1) (a Pfaff-Fuss or 3-Raney sequence).
%F A062747 G.f.: (2*c(3; 4*x)-1)/(1+x) with c(3; x)= RootOf(x*_Z^3-_Z +1), the g.f. of A001764 [formula for a(n) and g.f. corrected by _Peter Bala_, Mar 26 2020].
%F A062747 Conjectural recurrence: n*(2*n+1)*a(n) = (4*n-3)*(13*n-4)*a(n-1) + 6*(3*n-1)*(3*n-2)*a(n-2) with a(0) = 1, a(1) = 7. - _Peter Bala_, Mar 25 2020
%F A062747 a(n) ~ 3^(3*n + 7/2) / (56 * sqrt(Pi) * n^(3/2)). - _Vaclav Kotesovec_, Sep 04 2026
%t A062747 Table[(-1)^n + Sum[(-1)^(n-j) * 2^(2*j+1) * Binomial[3*j, j] / (2*j+1), {j, 1, n}], {n, 0, 20}] (* _Vaclav Kotesovec_, Sep 04 2026 *)
